1
00:00:00,447 --> 00:00:01,697
(Leonard:)Do you really want that?

2
00:00:02,074 --> 00:00:04,074
(Sheldon:)That's the great thing.
It doesn't matter.

3
00:00:04,243 --> 00:00:08,163
(Sheldon:)My mind is freed up
to think about more important things.

4
00:00:08,539 --> 00:00:09,959
(Raj:)What's it thinking about now?

5
00:00:10,291 --> 00:00:12,251
(Sheldon:)Hamburgers and lemonade.

6
00:00:14,169 --> 00:00:17,049
(Penny:)Um, Raj, there's someone
I want you to meet.

7
00:00:17,214 --> 00:00:20,464
(Penny:)This is my friend, Emily.
I know her from spin class.

8
00:00:21,677 --> 00:00:25,307
No. Raj, relax.
She can't hear you. She's deaf.

9
00:00:27,266 --> 00:00:30,396
(Howard(signing):)Emily, this is our friend Raj.

10
00:00:30,936 --> 00:00:32,856
- Heh.
- Aw.

11
00:00:34,648 --> 00:00:38,318
(Penny:)Look at you guys, just hitting it off.
I am so good.

12
00:00:44,283 --> 00:00:45,413
(Sheldon:)Hi.

13
00:00:47,703 --> 00:00:49,373
She says, "It's nice to meet you."

14
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:52,870
Did she really mean that
or was she signing it sarcastically?

15
00:00:54,209 --> 00:00:58,019
Raj says, "It's nice to meet you too." Heh.

